FAIL an action with outcomes: call carries the step's token, the wait is recorded; no move keeps timers and places: {'snapshot': {'at': 'item', 'resume': {'shop': 'item'}, 'timers': {'remind': 3}, 'pending': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}], 'seq': 6}, 'actions': [{'call': 'check_stock'}]} ≠ expected {'snapshot': {'at': 'item', 'resume': {'shop': 'item'}, 'timers': {'remind': 3}, 'seq': 6, 'pending': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}]}, 'actions': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}]}
FAIL a background action with outcomes: call carries token and detached: {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 1}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'detached': True}]} ≠ expected {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 1}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1, 'detached': True}]}
FAIL every: a new call adds its own wait, the newest first: {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 2}, {'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 2}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'detached': True}]} ≠ expected {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 2}, {'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 2}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 2, 'detached': True}]}
FAIL without every: a new call of the action replaces its wait: {'snapshot': {'at': 'item', 'resume': {'shop': 'item'}, 'timers': {'remind': 3}, 'pending': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}], 'seq': 6}, 'actions': [{'call': 'check_stock'}]} ≠ expected {'snapshot': {'at': 'item', 'resume': {'shop': 'item'}, 'timers': {'remind': 3}, 'seq': 6, 'pending': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}]}, 'actions': [{'call': 'check_stock', 'token': 6}]}
FAIL start with the event of an arrow without a target: its actions, then the initial message: {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'timers': {'idle': 1}, 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 1}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'detached': True}, {'start_timer': 'idle', 'ms': 60000, 'token': 1}, {'send': 'home'}]} ≠ expected {'snapshot': {'at': 'home', 'timers': {'idle': 1}, 'pending': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1}], 'seq': 1}, 'actions': [{'call': 'ping', 'token': 1, 'detached': True}, {'start_timer': 'idle', 'ms': 60000, 'token': 1}, {'send': 'home'}]}
